---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Disclosure"
  eyebrow="Site information"
  description={`How ${SITE.name} uses advertising, affiliate links, and licensed illustrative images across its guides.`}
  lede="How commercial links and illustrative images appear here."
>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some articles contain affiliate links. If you buy through one, this site may earn a commission. Articles containing product recommendations show a disclosure near the recommendations. Prices and availability are set by the retailer and may change.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>This site uses Google AdSense code. Advertising may appear when the site is approved and ad placements are enabled. Advertisements are separate from the article text.</p>

  <h2>Photography</h2>
  <p>Articles may use stock images from Unsplash, Pexels, or other licensed sources. Where a source credit is available it appears with the image. Stock images illustrate an idea; they are not evidence that we built or tested the pictured room or product. If you believe an image is credited incorrectly, <a href="/contact/">send us the page URL</a>.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>For questions about a recommendation or disclosure, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
